  <article style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">1. American Samoa Territorial Governance (SST)</h3>
    <p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7;">
      Samoa Standard Time (UTC-11) is the official time zone of American Samoa, an unincorporated US territory comprising Tutuila, Ofu, Olosega, Taʻu, Rose Atoll, and Swains Island.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">2. Maritime Freight & Commercial Tuna Fisheries</h3>
    <p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7;">
      Pago Pago Harbor hosts one of the deepest natural harbors in the South Pacific, serving as a major hub for international tuna purse seiners and canning operations shipping seafood globally.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">3. US Federal Island Territories (Midway Atoll)</h3>
    <p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7;">
      Midway Atoll National Wildlife Refuge, along with unorganized US islands like Jarvis Island and Palmyra Atoll, operates on UTC-11 for environmental monitoring and wildlife protection logs.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">4. Global Universal Time Reference (GMT)</h3>
    <p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7;">
      Greenwich Mean Time (UTC+0) serves as the international solar baseline for maritime navigation, aviation flight plans, and global web server architectures.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">5. National Park Service Management (American Samoa)</h3>
    <p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7;">
      The National Park of American Samoa, the only US National Park south of the equator, coordinates ecological preservation guidelines and ranger patrol logs in SST.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">6. US Coast Guard & Pacific Search and Rescue</h3>
    <p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7;">
      Coast Guard Sector Honolulu and regional maritime search and rescue operations log distress beacons in UTC, converting operational timelines to local SST for ground team deployment.
    </p>
